---
layout: null
---
{%- comment -%}
One food's calendar, at /remind/<slug>.ics: its season starts, as the
whole-site feed has them (_includes/ics-events.html), named for the food
so a calendar app lists it as "Rhubarb season". The page is a stub under
_remind/ naming the slug.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign food = site.data.foods | where: "slug", page.slug | first -%}
{%- assign year = site.time | date: "%Y" -%}
{%- assign jan1 = year | append: "-01-01" | date: "%s" | plus: 0 %}
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Is It Rhubarb Yet//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
X-WR-CALNAME:{{ food.name }} season
{% include ics-events.html food=food jan1=jan1 -%}
END:VCALENDAR
